OL,3,GNEWSADerry Halloween festival goers
OL,4,Asnap up 40th anniversary tickets
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of free tickets have
OL,7,Fbeen snapped up in three days by people
OL,8,Fkeen to mark the 40th anniversary of
OL,9,FEurope's biggest Halloween party.
OL,11,FLondonderry's Halloween festival has
OL,12,Fgrown exponentially since official
OL,13,Fcivic celebration launched in 1986 `
OL,14,Fmore than 100,000 people flocked to
OL,15,FDerry at Halloween last year.
OL,17,FFor the first time this year, a
OL,18,Fticketing system for part of the
OL,19,Ffestival ` the Awakening the Walled
OL,20,FCity Trail on the city's Walls ` has
OL,21,Fbeen introduced.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
