OL,3,GNEWSADerry Halloween festival goers
OL,4,Asnap up 40th anniversary tickets
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 25,000 of the total 36,750
OL,7,Fticket allocation have been booked
OL,8,Fsince the system went live at noon on
OL,9,FMonday, organisers Derry City and
OL,10,FStrabane District Council said.
